{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Borel 子群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Borel子群"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Borel 子群是 Lie 群 (或代数群) 极大的"},{"Local":{"url":"可解群","text":"可解"}},{"Plain":"闭子群.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>Borel 子群两两共轭.</p>\n<p>每个 Borel 子群 $B \\subset G$ 都等于其"},{"Local":{"url":"正规化子","text":"正规化子"}},{"Plain":" $N_G(B)$.</p>\n<p>任何两个 Borel 子群的交都包含一个"},{"Local":{"url":"极大环面","text":"极大环面"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>(特征 $0$) Borel 子群的 Lie 代数是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Borel子代数","text":"Borel 子代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$\\mathrm {GL}_n$ 的一个 Borel 子群是上三角矩阵的子群.</p>\n"}]}}